# zhihu-backup

- Storage changes go through `StorageEngine` (`sqlite` / `json` / `rocksdb`).
- Content paths: `data/contents/.../{type}_{parent?}_{zhihu_id}.md` — parent when present (e.g. `answer_{qid}_{aid}`); no Chinese filenames.
- Meta key: `{type}:{parent_id}:{zhihu_id}` or `{type}:{zhihu_id}`.
- Meta `items.extra` + frontmatter: typed IDs (`answer_id`/`question_id`, …); `item_assets` links item_key → asset URLs (keep global `assets` for dedupe).
- Default sync is incremental (`updated_at`); do not force `--full` unless asked.
- Cookie/state live in `data/meta/`; never commit secrets.
- CLI agent mode: prefer `--json` (stdout JSON, stderr logs).
- MVP: no Zhihu-side cleanup, no auto `x-zse-96`, no GUI.
